      <rules>
        <rule id="f721-bedd-b7e0-2468" name="All Aboard!" hidden="false">
          <description>At the start of the shooting phase roll a D6. On the roll of a 1, none of the tank&apos;s weapons may fire this turn as a fight breaks out inside the tank. On a 2+, the Mega-tank may fire its weapons and may select a different target for each gun if it wishes!</description>
