                <rule id="1ecd-bdf9-6d74-5e34" name="Banna Wavva" hidden="false">
                  <description>May carry a bosspole or a Waaagh! banner instead of the owner. Only the luckiest Grots are chosen for the job and they always seem to know when tododge behind the nearest cover, or Ork, to avoid fire. Consequently, the Banna Wavva is only removed as a casualty when there are no other models that could be removed instead. Banna Wavvas are armed with a Grot blasta.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
